==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'mammoth]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Metal Snache]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The first somewhat challenging stage, Mammothe hits quite hard and has decent hp, while the Steel Snakes get in the way. Thankfully they aren't infinite and spawn quite slowly, so either hitting them 110 times or critting them and getting some hits on Mammothe isn't too hard. Alternatively you can try to use [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attacks]] using the Snakes as a stepping stone, but Mammothe's own waves may get in the way.

